{
  "_readme": [
    "Every image the Quest Navigator panel app (com.oculus.panelapp.library) pulls",
    "off Meta's CDN, read out of version 1046.0.0.217.430. The store API publishes",
    "none of it: each asset is an entry token compiled into the app, fetched from",
    "base + token with no token of your own and no relay.",
    "",
    "apps — the layered tile art the home screen composes a shelf tile from, one",
    "pair per theme as [background, foreground]. rlds is the theme before Aura,",
    "aura the current one; \"both\" is a single pair used under either. The app",
    "holds two sets and picks with a boolean, so there is no third.",
    "",
    "extras — everything in the same tables that no package claims: three tile",
    "pairs the app no longer references (named by their field in X.2d7), the home",
    "world thumbnails from X.1IW, and the system bar's long-press animation from",
    "X.1IY, which is a 3 MB GIF.",
    "",
    "84 tile assets, 6 home world images, 1 animation. Sizes vary (150 and 180 px",
    "squares, and the worlds come as WebP served as octet-stream), so the page",
    "shows each at whatever size the file turns out to be."
  ],
